# Deliver the parcel currently in the gripper and fly back to the depot.
#
# Either name a location from the city map...
string location
# ...or give an explicit dropoff point in the world frame (used when `location` is empty).
# z is the height of the surface the parcel ends up on.
geometry_msgs/Point dropoff
# Replace dropoff.z with the surface height from the city map (roofs, ground).
bool snap_to_surface
---
bool success
bool delivered
string message
float64 flight_time
float64 distance_flown
---
string state
string detail
string leg
float64 leg_remaining
uint32 waypoint
uint32 waypoint_count
bool avoiding
